# Warg Tactics, second mode: Hercules, Prince of Power (3/3) gets a +1/+1 counter (4/4) and gains trample and hexproof until end
# of turn. On turn 3, with it on the battlefield, Bot2 cannot aim Get Lost at it (hexproof; refusal) but can at Bot1's Ornithopter
# (the control, which dies). On Bot1's turn 5 the hexproof has ended (CR 514.2), the counter and 4/4 have not, and Bot2's
# second Get Lost destroys Hercules. Bot2's creature is refused as the Warg's target (it targets "a creature you control").

